{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/extras/ef741f1f2ebcbaa806ca38a77b07c143.poster.avif?t=1772815829\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/extras/ef741f1f2ebcbaa806ca38a77b07c143.webm?t=1772815829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/extras/ef741f1f2ebcbaa806ca38a77b07c143.mp4?t=1772815829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is Flaurel (Flaurel Gerania el Karyana). A cheerful blonde girl with a hint of green in her hair who is always ready to help anyone. In her day-to-day life, Flaurel works part-time at Mrs. Ningsih\u2019s flower shop, caring for the plants, looking after the store, serving customers, and carefully arranging bouquets while continuously learning about new types of flowers. Behind her warm smile, Flaurel is also rather trusting, so she needs to stay cautious when dealing with people who have bad intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside of work hours, Flaurel often accompanies her best friend, Eins, helping with homework, organizing a schedule so Eins stays responsible, and sometimes joining in games to keep Eins motivated. With her love of nature and animals, her good cooking skills, and her consistently positive attitude, Flaurel\u2019s journey at the flower shop isn\u2019t just about business, it\u2019s also about friendship, family, and finding the best way to help others. Occasionally, Flaurel can transform into a winged chibi form to travel long distances, although she rarely uses it because it makes it difficult for her to help others the way she usually does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you\u2019ll do:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill with a cozy slice-of-life story about the little things that matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a few easy mini-games to keep things fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Flaurel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re into anime-style visual novels or just curious about who Flaurel really is, I hope you enjoy hanging out with her as much as I enjoyed bringing her to life. Thanks for playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/extras/d34bda6ef08c4aab63ba7a73dd7f53ce.avif?t=1772815829\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/extras_big/d34bda6ef08c4aab63ba7a73dd7f53ce.webp?t=1772815829 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Flaurel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913990/68d4e5cd4390b887440791016f1cc7cb35232a38.jpg"},{"name":"Mrs Ningsih","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913990/eef8a7b66b7d171f993a948046a884196ec1a221.jpg"},{"name":"Eins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913990/781a4738a28a877a2a5356f025a85f170632617a.jpg"},{"name":"Angga","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913990/3b3d32fc7d10b5de686a4582f6b15a8bb9e004bd.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913990/ab68c92f14c9cdd616cf5e78e413e9888b783c97.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913990/eed9200ab202e1b4fb5ff21a21e4817a032b52f9.jpg"},{"name":"Mr Benson","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913990/25c01c07815ed9b69151d6385b246363650a07e2.jpg"},{"name":"Teona","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913990/52aa2efea923c82ca43803ebc3c47df3d84f3213.jpg"},{"name":"Flaurel Notices You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913990/b592dadba67f55796976567ab98b2d1753b70380.jpg"},{"name":"We are Close Friends Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913990/28d1ff5f78541ade78dd8d564249f4be053b76dd.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913990?t=1772815829","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/d5f2ebd560b5a5fee765e59068bcdce79dcc85fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772815829","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/b06883f03f8ee0778243d0503d0354aeb3e1c4e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772815829","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/b06883f03f8ee0778243d0503d0354aeb3e1c4e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772815829","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/extras/ef741f1f2ebcbaa806ca38a77b07c143.poster.avif?t=1772815829\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913990/extras/ef741f1f2ebcbaa806ca38a77b07c143.webm?t=1772815829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391399